usage-codebuff-setting-api-key = 来自 https://www.codebuff.com 的 Codebuff API 密钥。它仅读取额度余额；未设置时，将使用 `codebuff login` 的会话，该会话还会读取套餐和每周限额。
usage-codebuff-setting-base-url = 用于替换 https://www.codebuff.com 的 https URL，例如用于预发布服务器。其他协议会被忽略，以确保令牌不会以未加密方式传输。

usage-codebuff-credits = 额度
usage-codebuff-remaining = 剩余
usage-codebuff-account = 账户
usage-codebuff-subscription = 订阅
usage-codebuff-auto-top-up = 自动充值
usage-codebuff-on = 开启
usage-codebuff-off = 关闭
